(text "08 | RGB status LED" (at 12.7 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3c1eae7d-6eb7-5197-ab34-b5b99acd628b"))
(text "D901: OptoSupply OSTAPA57E2A, diffused RGB, COMMON ANODE on +12V. Pins 1 G, 2 B, 3 A, 4 R. Form leads from 1.25 to 2.54 mm pitch; body raised 5 mm above PCB.\nEach channel: GPIO -> 4k7 -> BC847B base (100k to GND), collector -> 2k -> LED cathode. The 12 V supply makes the current independent of the Vf of the green and blue dies\n(a 3.3 V supply leaves only 0.1-0.3 V across a resistor for Vf 3.0-3.2 V). ~4.9 mA red, ~4.4 mA green/blue; resistor 49 mW; 100k keeps the LED dark during reset.\nGPIO4 = red, GPIO16 = green, GPIO17 = blue (module pins 26/27/28; no strapping function, free on WROOM-32E-N4). Drive with LEDC PWM; HIGH = channel on.\nThe 12 V rail is off below ~14 V input, so the indicator is dark exactly when the ESP32 is not running." (at 12.7 251 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6cc456e2-0aba-5a4d-a171-1f2a413a46a4"))
(symbol (lib_id "EU_LITE:LED_RGB_CA") (at 119.38 69.85 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "ce659172-5f44-5cfc-95c9-b47c41fb4567")
